### ChildProfile API Tests

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7089
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Create Child Profile (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ChildProfile HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAxLzA0L3htbGRzaWctbW9yZSNobWFjLXNoYTI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..NdbQ-WNoUxe4vg5Pdw2REVoo8h6y-ZWuob8vcQn4w10

{
  "nickname": "Test Child",
  "ageInYears": 5,
  "ageInMonths": 3,
  "gender": 1,
  "supportNeedsLevel": 2,
  "mainDailyChallengesJson": "[\"Communication\", \"Social interaction\"]",
  "strengthsAndInterests": "Loves music and animals",
  "prefersVisualSchedules": true,
  "communicationMethodsJson": "[\"Visual aids\", \"Sign language\"]"
}

### 2. Get Child Profile (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ChildProfile/GetProfile HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Update Child Profile (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ChildProfile/UpdateProfile HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "nickname": "Updated Test Child",
  "ageInYears": 6,
  "ageInMonths": 0,
  "gender": 1,
  "supportNeedsLevel": 3,
  "mainDailyChallengesJson": "[\"Communication\", \"Social interaction\", \"Sensory processing\"]",
  "strengthsAndInterests": "Loves music, animals, and swimming",
  "prefersVisualSchedules": true,
  "communicationMethodsJson": "[\"Visual aids\", \"Sign language\", \"Simple words\"]"
}

